# Diff drivers that make local `git diff` hunk headers match the `patch` text
# GitHub's compare API returns. Used by drift_core.local_file_patches only.
#
# Verified against merged PRs in this repository (tests/test_github_diff_parity.py).
# Markdown must stay on git's default driver: diff=markdown does NOT match GitHub.
# Other languages are unverified, so they are left on the default for now.
*.py diff=python
